:: WLI Wraith Bad End Escape
<<effects>>
It pulls your body upright and walks you towards the door.
<br><br>
Your legs shake as soon as they take your weight. You try to bend your knees and drop back down,
but they keep carrying you forwards.
<br><br>
Your body walks through the doorway at the wrong angle, and your shoulder hits the frame hard enough to make your arm jerk.
You try to turn away from it, but your body takes another step and drives the same shoulder into the wood again.
<br><br>
And again.
<br><br>
Again.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Wraith Bad End Caught]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Wraith Bad End Caught
<<effects>>
You can feel every hit. You try to pull your arm back, turn your head, or stop your legs from moving, but nothing responds.
Your body keeps pushing through the doorway while you remain trapped inside it.
<br><br>
<span class="wraith">"Mine,"</span> it says with your mouth. <span class="wraith">"Not theirs."</span>
<br><br>
Your shoulder hits the frame again. This time, part of the wood breaks off.
Your body keeps pushing forwards until it can get through the doorway.
It walks you into the corridor without giving you time to recover. One of your legs can barely support you now,
so your foot drags across the floor between each step.
<br><br>
Your body makes you tread on a piece of broken wood. Pain shoots up your leg, and you try to lift the foot away from it.
But your body puts the foot down again and keeps walking on it.
<br><br>
<<set $pain to 100>>
<span class="red">You are hurting yourself, and you cannot stop.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Wraith Bad End Caught 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Wraith Bad End Caught 2
<<effects>>
You somehow keep moving, despite how much you ache and how tired you are.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Wraith Bad End Caught 3]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Wraith Bad End Caught 3
<<effects>>
You do not get far enough before voices rise behind you and several people rush into the corridor.
<br><br>
Hands grab at your arms and waist. Instead of trying to escape, your body turns to face them,
forcing your sore shoulder up as though it still expects to fight.
<br><br>
Whatever is controlling you keeps pushing forwards.
<br><br>
It ignores the pain in your shoulder and the leg dragging behind you,
but your body cannot match what it wants to do anymore.
<br><br>
One person grabs your wrist before you can swing at them. Another grabs you around the waist,
pulling you back as your sore leg slips beneath you.
You keep struggling because the thing controlling you refuses to stop,
even when your body no longer has the strength to break free.
<br><br>
They put you on the floor. Pain builds in your head as your vision starts to blur.
Something inside you seems to fight for control one last time.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Wraith Bad End Caught 4]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Wraith Bad End Caught 4
<<effects>>
Then it suddenly lets go, leaving your body to collapse under its own weight.
<br><br>
<span class="wraith">"...I will come back for it."</span><<gobsession 3>>
<br><br>
<<wraithExorcise true true>>
<<link [[Next|WLI Wraith Bad End Aftermath]]>><<set $pain to 0>><<set _rng to random(60, 240)>><<pass _rng>><</link>>
<br>

:: WLI Wraith Bad End Aftermath
<<effects>>
You wake up after they carry you back and leave you in your usual place.
<br><br>
Everything hurts now that you have control of your body again.
Your shoulder aches whenever you try to move that arm, and your foot is tender to stand on.
<br><br>
You remember what happened last time. You were awake while something else moved your body,
but nobody watching could see that. They only saw you force your way through the door,
keep walking while you could barely stand, and refuse to stop.
<br><br>
<span class="red">You ache all over, and they are watching you far more closely now.</span>
<<pain 30>><<gggpain>><<for _b to 0; _b lt 6; _b++>><<bruise face>><<bruise leftarm>><<bruise rightarm>><</for>>
<<gggtrauma>><<trauma 18>>
<<gggstress>><<stress 20>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|WLI Wraith Bad End Return]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: WLI Wraith Bad End Return
<<effects>>
The mark on your skin is still warm. <span class="red">Whatever left it is not finished with you yet.</span>
<br><br>
You stay lying down, hoping that nothing happens if you do not move.
<br><br>
<<set _ret to ($wli.escapeReturn and Story.has($wli.escapeReturn)) ? $wli.escapeReturn : "Bed">>
<<link "Next" _ret>><<endevent>><<unset $wli.escapeReturn>><</link>>
<br>
